### Create image task
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/image-tasks
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "prompt": "a realistic train running on railway tracks",
  "negativePrompt": "blurry, low quality",
  "width": 512,
  "height": 512,
  "steps": 20,
  "cfgScale": 7,
  "seed": 12345
}

### Get API test cases
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-cases
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create public API test case - login endpoint
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test-cases
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Login endpoint should return 200",
  "method": "POST",
  "url": "https://localhost:7074/api/auth/login",
  "headersJson": null,
  "bodyJson": "{\"email\":\"test2@example.com\",\"password\":\"P@ssw0rd123\"}",
  "expectedStatusCode": 200
}

### Run API test case
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/test-cases/7/run
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get API test case runs
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/test-cases/7/runs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}